1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,933
Nine repositories worth a closer look.

2
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:09,467
ECC packages skills,
agents, and hooks.

3
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:15,033
CLI-Anything turns desktop
software into command-line tools.

4
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:20,833
Screenshot-to-code turns
reference images into web layouts.

5
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:26,300
ScrapeGraphAI extracts
web data from prompts.

6
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:31,433
Google Skills adds agent skills for
cloud and developer workflows.

7
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:37,100
DeepSeek Harness is a
plugin-based agent framework.

8
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:42,833
Humanizer rewrites prose
that sounds AI-generated.

9
00:00:42,833 --> 00:00:47,633
Stop Slop adds writing rules and
a rubric for reviewing prose.

10
00:00:47,633 --> 00:00:53,033
OmniRoute routes requests
across model providers.

11
00:00:53,033 --> 00:00:57,467
The pattern? More tools are
now packaged for agents to use.

12
00:00:57,467 --> 00:01:02,000
Pick what fits your workflow.
Read the README first.

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,467
